#
# The iPod photo's 220x176 screen: RockWheel's 320x240 skin of the same name
# (themes/iClassic-Square/.rockbox/wps) laid out for it, with the same pictures
# at their own sizes (themes/tools/make_classic_220x176.py). No pane beside
# the main menu: every list takes the screen's width.
#
# WPS File
#
